"entity": {
"name": "HDB Financial Services Ltd",
"description": "HDB Financial Services Ltd. engages in the provision of loan products and insurance services. It operates through the Lending Business and Business Process Outsourcing (BPO) Services segments. The Lending Services segment includes providing finance to retail customers for a variety of purposes, like purchase of commercial equipment and commercial vehicles. The BPO Services segment covers sales support services, back office, operations, processing support, running collection call centers, and collecting overdue amounts from borrowers. The company was founded on June 4, 2007 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.",
